<title>GERMANY: Deutsche Telekom rough quote due late-morning.</title>
<headline>Deutsche Telekom rough quote due late-morning.</headline>
<dateline>FRANKFURT 1996-11-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>A first estimate of the price at which shares in newly-floated Deutsche Telekom AG are changing hands is due at around 1030 GMT, a spokeswoman for the Deutsche Boerse stock exchange said on Monday.</p>
<p>That should then be followed an hour later by a first official quotation at around 1130 GMT, the spokeswoman added.</p>
<p>She stressed that both times were not fixed and depended on when the correct price could be calculated from actual trade.</p>
<p>Deutsche Telekom, whose shares were on Sunday priced at 28.50 marks each, are due to start trade when the Frankfurt bourse opens at 0930 GMT.</p>
<p>--Frankfurt Newsroom +49 69 756525</p>
</text>
